{"id":"c0adaf80b9cae9e6","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-solovay-lem1.md","title":"Solovay Lemma 1","display":"lem-solovay-lem1 — Solovay Lemma 1","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-solovay-lem1","aliases":["89-lem-solovay-lem1"],"display":"lem-solovay-lem1 — Solovay Lemma 1","depends_on":["[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","[[89-df-gl-finite-model]]","[[89-df-gl-semantic]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-solovay-lem1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-solovay-lem1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-solovay-lem1 — Solovay Lemma 1"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" href=\"?note=b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" title=\"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5026751112f75f31\" href=\"?note=5026751112f75f31\" title=\"89-df-gl-finite-model\">89-df-gl-finite-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f2ee867f14428e3\" href=\"?note=7f2ee867f14428e3\" title=\"89-df-gl-semantic\">89-df-gl-semantic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For each set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> of Kripke models,\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\)</span>\nhave the signatures fixed by their defining atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}lem1}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal U\\;\\exists M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\\;\n\\exists w_{0}\\in W\\;\nM,w_{0}\\not\\models A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}lem1}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal U\\;\\exists M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\\;\n\\exists w_{0}\\in W\\;\nM,w_{0}\\not\\models A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>由 GL 的有限模型性质先取得有限点反模型</li>\n<li>该模型随后用于构造 Solovay 函数与算术反解释</li>\n<li>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,A)\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\">\\((M,A)\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\)</span> 展开全局真值\n即得到所需的反例世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_0\">\\(w_0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-finite-model","status":"resolved","id":"5026751112f75f31","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-finite-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-semantic","status":"resolved","id":"7f2ee867f14428e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-semantic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}lem1}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal U\\;\\exists M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathrm{GLFMod}(\\mathcal U)\\;\n\\exists w_{0}\\in W\\;\nM,w_{0}\\not\\models A.","display":true},{"tex":"(M,A)\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"w_0","display":false}],"bytes":1116,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-434","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-lem1]]"}],"outgoing":["b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","5026751112f75f31","7f2ee867f14428e3","9f00301866fbd6f0"]}